1
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,000
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:51,000
[Episode 24]

3
00:02:12,220 --> 00:02:13,130
Fu Shize,

4
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,340
where on earth are you?

5
00:02:15,370 --> 00:02:16,410
Why can't you

6
00:02:16,410 --> 00:02:17,750
stay by my side

7
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:19,030
like Yunyi?

8
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,400
Lili.

9
00:03:34,390 --> 00:03:38,040
♪ Dust upon time ♪

10
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,240
Let's break up.

11
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,430
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

12
00:03:43,250 --> 00:03:46,430
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

13
00:03:47,350 --> 00:03:50,750
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

14
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:55,630
Is it because

15
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,930
I didn't go to see you?

16
00:04:01,430 --> 00:04:02,680
That's one reason.

17
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:04,510
But there are others.

18
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,630
I'm sorry.

19
00:04:09,410 --> 00:04:11,340
I've been busy these past two days.

20
00:04:13,930 --> 00:04:15,020
With what?

21
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,010
Lili, I...

22
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:20,540
It's just like before.

23
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:21,630
You can't say anything,

24
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:22,370
can you?

25
00:04:23,580 --> 00:04:24,380
Fu Shize.

26
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,420
Whenever you have a problem,

27
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:28,980
you never tell me.

28
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,870
There are so many things about you

29
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:32,540
that I don't know.

30
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,980
Now that I need you,

31
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:39,580
you're not by my side either.

32
00:04:43,570 --> 00:04:44,370
I'm sorry.

33
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:47,260
I'm tired.

34
00:04:48,990 --> 00:04:50,300
You have your own world

35
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,720
that I can never get into.

36
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:54,040
And I don't want to try so hard

37
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,330
to squeeze in anymore.

38
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,100
Let's break up.

39
00:05:03,010 --> 00:05:05,540
I've... decided to study abroad.

40
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:06,820
♪ I'm in the dark of night ♪

41
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:09,040
♪ Let all my thoughts settle down ♪

42
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:12,050
♪ Practise pretending I don't miss you ♪

43
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:15,570
♪ Maybe one day ♪

44
00:05:15,590 --> 00:05:17,850
♪ Be a little more honest ♪

45
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:21,610
♪ Will it be fulfilled? ♪

46
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:26,230
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

47
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,270
Okay.

48
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:30,030
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

49
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:34,390
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

50
00:05:34,409 --> 00:05:38,500
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

51
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:45,430
♪ The story is not finished yet ♪

52
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,480
♪ Half drifting apart ♪

53
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,680
♪ Half a hug we share ♪

54
00:05:51,770 --> 00:05:55,430
♪ A goodnight too late ♪

55
00:05:55,740 --> 00:05:57,940
♪ Let the moon be half-lit ♪

56
00:05:58,170 --> 00:06:00,460
♪ Clouds half-hidden too ♪

57
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:01,160
Maybe it's for the best.

58
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:09,710
♪ Let me brave once more ♪

59
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:45,270
Yun Ye?

60
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,980
You're awake?

61
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,980
Yunyi?

62
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:52,570
How do you feel?

63
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,400
I'm okay.

64
00:06:57,110 --> 00:06:58,440
What doesn't kill you

65
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:00,910
makes you stronger, right?

66
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,610
Don't cry.

67
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,560
Don't cry.

68
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,070
I'm so afraid of seeing you cry.

69
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,220
When you cry,

70
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:18,330
I feel worse than you do.

71
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,540
In my current state,

72
00:07:22,250 --> 00:07:23,690
I can't even get up

73
00:07:23,690 --> 00:07:25,310
to act like a monkey for you.

74
00:07:30,330 --> 00:07:31,130
Alright.

75
00:07:31,870 --> 00:07:33,040
I won't cry.

76
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,740
Does it hurt?

77
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:39,270
Seeing you,

78
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:41,830
it doesn't hurt anymore.

79
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:47,040
When did you get here?

80
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:49,960
My brother brought me here yesterday.

81
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,870
You've been here with me for a whole day?

82
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,040
I wanted you to see me

83
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,270
as soon as you woke up.

84
00:08:01,630 --> 00:08:02,560
Are you alright?

85
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:04,770
Does the wound hurt?

86
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:06,880
I'll go get the doctor.

87
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:07,930
Yunyi!

88
00:08:20,610 --> 00:08:21,690
Thank you.

89
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,620
Still studying?

90
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,170
Can't you take a break?

91
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:51,050
I promised Yunyi

92
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:52,910
that we'd get into XUST together.

93
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,880
No one can stop me from studying.

94
00:08:55,790 --> 00:08:58,340
Can't you study after you recover?

95
00:08:58,620 --> 00:08:59,940
Don't get sick again.

96
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:02,340
Otherwise, someone

97
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,630
will be sad.

98
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:07,630
Got it.

99
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:11,240
Come on. Eat the porridge first.

100
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,300
Put the book aside.

101
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,370
Put it away.

102
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,300
Come on.

103
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,740
Yun Li, you're my sister,

104
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:20,480
not my mom.

105
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,680
I can drink it myself.

106
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,360
I'll watch you drink it.

107
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:27,790
It's hot. Blow on it.

108
00:09:29,470 --> 00:09:29,940
Yun Li,

109
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:31,740
when are you going back to Nanwu?

110
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:32,910
Why?

111
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,670
I think you're too noisy here.

112
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:35,320
If you want to be noisy,

113
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,840
go be noisy next to your boyfriend,

114
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,460
okay?

115
00:09:37,530 --> 00:09:39,060
I need some peace and quiet.

116
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:43,600
What's...

117
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:45,370
What's wrong?

118
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:51,980
We... broke up.

119
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:54,860
Broke up?

120
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:55,890
Who brought it up?

121
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:58,770
I did.

122
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:02,580
Didn't you chase him for 7 years?

123
00:10:02,610 --> 00:10:04,340
And you just let it go like that?

124
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,760
It wasn't that long.

125
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:09,650
Besides,

126
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,840
chasing someone is one thing,

127
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,170
breaking up is another.

128
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,520
They're not the same.

129
00:10:19,490 --> 00:10:21,340
Why did you break up with him?

130
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,530
Why?

131
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,690
He just doesn't like me that much anymore.

132
00:10:32,870 --> 00:10:35,870
Did he tell you that,

133
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:37,910
or did you just think that yourself?

134
00:10:40,940 --> 00:10:42,480
The problems between us

135
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:45,370
didn't just start a day or two ago.

136
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,210
So we broke up. It's no big deal.

137
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:52,600
It's normal for couples

138
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,410
to break up.

139
00:10:58,620 --> 00:10:59,410
Li.

140
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,500
Li.

141
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,760
It's okay to be sad.

142
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,170
It's not embarrassing.

143
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:16,040
Besides, you still have me.

144
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,070
You and Yunyi

145
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:20,370
are both number one in my heart.

146
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:29,450
Don't cry, Li.

147
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,620
Why are you drinking during the day?

148
00:11:57,630 --> 00:11:59,030
Your stomach has only just gotten better.

149
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:00,440
Do you want to have another surgery?

150
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,630
Do I have to drink
just because I'm at a bar?

151
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:04,290
Then why did you ask me to come?

152
00:12:07,820 --> 00:12:08,630
No reason.

153
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:12,470
Just keep me company for a while.

154
00:12:14,590 --> 00:12:15,940
How about I move in with you

155
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:17,540
and stay with you for a while?

156
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:22,490
How about this?

157
00:12:22,670 --> 00:12:24,480
I'll have Jiameng book you a flight.

158
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,980
Go abroad and cheer yourself up.

159
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:26,770
No need.

160
00:12:30,190 --> 00:12:31,100
EAW

161
00:12:32,530 --> 00:12:34,190
not going to EAW in the future.

162
00:12:36,410 --> 00:12:37,810
You've made up your mind?

163
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,130
Hello?

164
00:13:02,650 --> 00:13:04,340
How's your packing going?

165
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,820
Pretty much done.

166
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,410
Do you have a lot of stuff?

167
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:07,980
If you do,

168
00:13:07,980 --> 00:13:09,710
I'll have Fu Zhengchu come help you move.

169
00:13:09,710 --> 00:13:11,840
It's fine. I can take it all in one trip.

170
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:13,790
Lili,

171
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:16,500
did you guys
really just break up like that?

172
00:13:16,770 --> 00:13:17,790
You and Fu Shize...

173
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:19,620
I've thought it through.

174
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:22,880
Maybe we're just

175
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:24,310
not right for each other.

176
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:27,820
There's no need to bring him up anymore.

177
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:30,650
Alright, I got it.

178
00:13:29,570 --> 00:13:31,920
♪ Lingering right here ♪

179
00:13:32,180 --> 00:13:33,690
♪ Who tries to talk me down? ♪

180
00:13:33,730 --> 00:13:35,560
♪ Who makes excuses now? ♪

181
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:38,530
♪ Let memories trail in threads ♪

182
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:42,230
♪ Too shattered to pick up ♪

183
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:47,470
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

184
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:50,720
♪ Willingly I wait ♪

185
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:55,940
♪ To soothe the sorry I said yesterday ♪

186
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:58,480
♪ Half a phrase unspoken ♪

187
00:13:58,500 --> 00:14:01,760
♪ Always too late ♪

188
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:05,680
[Delete]

189
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:04,240
♪ Time freezes still ♪

190
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:07,300
♪ My care burns hot ♪

191
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:10,870
♪ Hidden from your sight ♪

192
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,670
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

193
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:29,700
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

194
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:36,050
♪ Hesitant feet—which side
should I stand on ♪

195
00:14:38,380 --> 00:14:41,060
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

196
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,670
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

197
00:14:42,690 --> 00:14:44,500
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

198
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:47,490
♪ This damp murmur ♪

199
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:52,250
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

200
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:56,110
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

201
00:14:56,140 --> 00:14:59,610
♪ For me to keep my promise ♪

202
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:04,950
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

203
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,320
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

204
00:15:07,350 --> 00:15:10,520
♪ Maybe someday ♪

205
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:13,380
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

206
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:20,060
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

207
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:31,180
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

208
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:46,180
[One Year Later]

209
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,080
The job market is so bad right now.

210
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,530
Since you have a place to intern,

211
00:15:51,530 --> 00:15:53,030
just work hard there.

212
00:15:53,030 --> 00:15:54,890
Don't take time off every few days

213
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:57,240
to shoot those meaningless videos,

214
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,410
okay?

215
00:15:59,080 --> 00:15:59,980
You only have one month left

216
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,530
before your full-time employee evaluation.

217
00:16:01,530 --> 00:16:03,270
Don't take it lightly.

218
00:16:04,010 --> 00:16:04,890
Got it, Dad.

219
00:16:04,890 --> 00:16:05,820
I'll help you

220
00:16:05,820 --> 00:16:06,790
keep an eye on Li.

221
00:16:06,790 --> 00:16:07,650
I promise.

222
00:16:07,650 --> 00:16:08,670
Wait. And you.

223
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:09,820
Getting into college

224
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:11,010
is just the first step

225
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:12,270
toward entering society.

226
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:13,080
At school,

227
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,870
you must get along well

228
00:16:15,010 --> 00:16:16,120
with your classmates.

229
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,130
Yes, Your Majesty.

230
00:16:17,130 --> 00:16:18,410
If you don't leave now,

231
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:20,550
you'll really be late
for the morning court.

232
00:16:20,550 --> 00:16:21,770
-Well...
-Alright.

233
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,030
You must

234
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:27,220
drive safely.

235
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:28,510
There are a lot of people at school.

236
00:16:28,510 --> 00:16:29,340
Yun Li,

237
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:29,870
double-check everything

238
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:30,910
one last time.

239
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:31,560
Don't forget anything.

240
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:32,440
Alright, Dad.

241
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:33,970
You really should go now.

242
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:34,740
Well...

243
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:36,530
It's not like I'm not coming back.

244
00:16:36,530 --> 00:16:37,770
Dad is so nagging.

245
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:40,200
We shouldn't have
left anything behind, right?

246
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,770
Li, I'm going to school,

247
00:16:41,770 --> 00:16:43,180
not fleeing from a disaster.

248
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:43,990
Vitamins.

249
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:46,440
Li, hurry up!

250
00:16:46,460 --> 00:16:48,860
Don't make Yunyi and the others
wait for us.

251
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:57,990
They haven't arrived yet.

252
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:04,910
Hello, Yucheng.

253
00:17:05,099 --> 00:17:06,010
Let me help you.

254
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,550
No need. I'll handle them.

255
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,510
Hello, Li.

256
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,140
You're getting prettier, Yunyi.

257
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:11,290
I parked my car over there.

258
00:17:11,290 --> 00:17:11,829
Let's go.

259
00:17:11,829 --> 00:17:12,349
Okay.

260
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:19,380
So?

261
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:20,810
Did you get some sleep on the plane?

262
00:17:20,810 --> 00:17:21,609
Are you tired?

263
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,530
I'm fine.

264
00:17:24,829 --> 00:17:26,089
When did you come back?

265
00:17:27,069 --> 00:17:28,329
More than 2 months ago.

266
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:31,530
How was your time in the UK?

267
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:33,810
Pretty good.

268
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,810
You're graduating next year, right?

269
00:17:36,810 --> 00:17:38,140
Are you going back soon?

270
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,220
The experiments are done.

271
00:17:40,220 --> 00:17:40,920
I plan to stay here

272
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,010
to finish my thesis

273
00:17:42,010 --> 00:17:43,880
and go back for the defense next year.

274
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,420
Do you plan to

275
00:17:45,740 --> 00:17:47,670
stay and work in Xifu in the future?

276
00:17:52,830 --> 00:17:53,740
Are you tired from the flight?

277
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:54,510
It's okay.

278
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:08,330
You guys go first.

279
00:18:08,330 --> 00:18:09,070
I'll go park the car.

280
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:10,070
I'll go with you.

281
00:18:10,070 --> 00:18:10,830
There are many cars
and the road is narrow.

282
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:11,510
It's not very safe.

283
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:12,030
It's fine.

284
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,510
Yunyi and Yun Ye are not very familiar
with this place.

285
00:18:13,510 --> 00:18:14,570
You take them in.

286
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,380
I'm going.

287
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,050
Li, be careful.

288
00:18:19,510 --> 00:18:20,310
Let's go.

289
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:53,400
Senior, here. Have some water.

290
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,840
