and Engineering.

345
00:22:57,110 --> 00:22:58,310
Can you give it to him?

346
00:22:59,140 --> 00:22:59,790
Yun Ye,

347
00:23:00,250 --> 00:23:01,640
you'd better pray that

348
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,770
