390
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:38,350
By the way,

391
00:27:38,740 --> 00:27:40,460
Uncle is doing his PhD at XUST.

392
00:27:40,460 --> 00:27:41,460
Have you seen him?

393
00:27:41,940 --> 00:27:42,740
No.

394
00:27:42,900 --> 00:27:44,300
We haven't been in touch.

395
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:47,090
Shut your big mouth.

396
00:27:48,090 --> 00:27:49,290
He doesn't think before he speaks.

397
00:27:49,290 --> 00:27:50,050
If you have a problem with him,

398
00:27:50,050 --> 00:27:51,200
I'll tell him to leave.

399
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,020
It's fine.

400
00:27:52,370 --> 00:27:53,370
It's been so long.

401
00:27:53,390 --> 00:27:54,850
I'm quite happy to see him.

402
00:28:00,790 --> 00:28:01,590
Fu Zhengchu.

403
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,200
Here.

404
00:28:04,550 --> 00:28:05,440
