406
00:28:08,790 --> 00:28:10,720
Lili, what would you like to drink?

407
00:28:11,590 --> 00:28:12,160
Juice?

408
00:28:12,350 --> 00:28:12,940
Okay.

409
00:28:15,790 --> 00:28:16,830
Impressive.

410
00:28:16,830 --> 00:28:19,790
You've got Fu Zhengchu completely
wrapped around your finger.

411
00:28:19,790 --> 00:28:20,720
Watch and learn.

412
00:28:23,620 --> 00:28:25,620
