421
00:28:54,420 --> 00:28:56,480
Rather than feeling like
the present isn't real,

422
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,480
it's more like

423
00:28:58,250 --> 00:28:59,350
the 6 months

424
00:28:59,350 --> 00:29:00,480
I spent with him

425
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:01,550
were unreal.

426
00:29:01,730 --> 00:29:03,010
It was like a dream.

427
00:29:03,700 --> 00:29:04,530
You made it sound like

428
00:29:04,530 --> 00:29:06,030
