429
00:29:12,900 --> 00:29:14,240
You don't want to
get back together with him, do you?

430
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:15,030
No.

431
00:29:16,660 --> 00:29:18,290
I don't like him anymore.

432
00:29:19,250 --> 00:29:20,050
That's good.

433
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:27,330
Hello?

434
00:29:27,810 --> 00:29:28,940
Li, where are you?

435
00:29:28,940 --> 00:29:29,610
My class is over.

436
00:29:29,610 --> 00:29:31,610
Wait a minute. I'll come pick you up.

437
00:29:32,460 --> 00:29:34,290
Tangy, I'll get going now.

438
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:36,530
You're leaving right after I got here?

439
00:29:38,300 --> 00:29:39,830
Then be careful on the road.

440
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,790
Watch out for...

441
00:29:45,140 --> 00:29:46,380
Lili, where are you going?

442
00:29:46,380 --> 00:29:48,240
I'm going to pick up my brother
from class.

443
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:48,970
Your juice.

444
00:29:49,350 --> 00:29:50,440
Thanks. Bye-bye.

445
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:50,980
Bye-bye.

446
00:29:59,740 --> 00:30:00,540
