447
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:01,460
It doesn't taste good.

448
00:30:01,460 --> 00:30:02,250
It doesn't?

449
00:30:04,790 --> 00:30:06,190
I'll get you another one.

450
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,660
I'll have another one.

451
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:19,730
