460
00:30:31,350 --> 00:30:32,750
Why should I delete them?

461
00:30:33,530 --> 00:30:35,460
I just don't want
to be abused by my girlfriend.

462
00:30:35,460 --> 00:30:37,290
A-Are you two together now?

463
00:30:37,700 --> 00:30:38,530
Not yet.

464
00:30:38,530 --> 00:30:39,250
I want to make

465
00:30:39,250 --> 00:30:40,760
