466
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:41,980
We have a lot of classes now.

467
00:30:41,980 --> 00:30:43,330
Neither of us wants to fall behind
in our studies,

468
00:30:43,330 --> 00:30:44,960
so I don't have time to prepare.

469
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:46,080
So we talked about it

470
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:47,500
