471
00:30:47,500 --> 00:30:49,760
You even need to discuss when to confess?

472
00:30:49,830 --> 00:30:51,560
Do you two discuss everything?

473
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,440
Yeah.

474
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:53,700
What's wrong?

475
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,030
Nothing.

476
00:31:00,140 --> 00:31:01,290
Yun Ye, let me ask you something.

477
00:31:01,290 --> 00:31:01,900
Do you know

478
00:31:01,900 --> 00:31:03,430
