479
00:31:03,740 --> 00:31:04,530
Who is it?

480
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:06,290
You really don't know?

481
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,030
I think it's a senior

482
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:11,000
