484
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,240
It's Fu Shize.

485
00:31:15,900 --> 00:31:16,850
No way.

486
00:31:17,330 --> 00:31:17,980
You...

487
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:22,140
Li, I swear

488
00:31:22,140 --> 00:31:23,540
I had no idea he was our TA.

489
00:31:23,750 --> 00:31:25,110
He wasn't there

490
00:31:25,110 --> 00:31:25,790
during registration,

491
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:26,460
and in the group chat,

492
00:31:26,460 --> 00:31:27,590
he was always listed as the TA.

493
00:31:27,590 --> 00:31:29,110
And I didn't see him today.

494
00:31:29,380 --> 00:31:30,420
He just put my book

495
00:31:30,420 --> 00:31:31,770
at the back of the classroom.

496
00:31:31,770 --> 00:31:33,200
If I'd known it was him,

497
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:34,400
I swear I would've...

498
00:31:37,140 --> 00:31:37,950
However...

499
00:31:38,660 --> 00:31:40,530
you two have been apart for so long.

500
00:31:40,530 --> 00:31:44,160
Seeing each other again shouldn't have
stirred up any feelings, right?

501
00:31:44,160 --> 00:31:44,960
No.

502
00:31:46,050 --> 00:31:47,570
See?

503
00:31:50,140 --> 00:31:51,140
Hello, Yunyi.

504
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,030
Li.

505
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,830
I'm going out with Yunyi tomorrow.

506
00:31:57,830 --> 00:31:59,160
Can you tell Dad that...

507
00:32:10,140 --> 00:32:11,740
