512
00:33:01,790 --> 00:33:03,190
Then I'll bring it to you.

513
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,000
Where are you?

514
00:33:10,790 --> 00:33:11,830
I'm not at school.

515
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:13,670
Would tomorrow work for you?

516
00:33:15,370 --> 00:33:15,870
Okay.

517
00:33:49,900 --> 00:33:50,700
Thanks.

518
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,640
Sorry for making you
come all the way here.

519
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:54,440
No worries.

520
00:33:54,460 --> 00:33:56,070
I'm free today anyway.

521
00:33:58,840 --> 00:34:00,240
So, what are you

522
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:02,160
