523
00:34:02,790 --> 00:34:04,090
I haven't decided yet.

524
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,340
You went out of your way
to bring me the key.

525
00:34:06,340 --> 00:34:07,630
Let me buy you a drink.

526
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:08,540
No need.

527
00:34:08,610 --> 00:34:10,340
I've got something to do later.

528
00:34:11,230 --> 00:34:13,429
