532
00:35:00,460 --> 00:35:01,260
Thank you.

533
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:05,920
Let's go.

534
00:35:14,130 --> 00:35:14,990
Let's sit here.

535
00:35:20,150 --> 00:35:21,000
I'll go order.

536
00:35:22,090 --> 00:35:24,150
