537
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,400
Matcha cake for dessert, just like before?

538
00:35:27,960 --> 00:35:28,570
Yeah.

539
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,730
He still remembers.

540
00:35:57,730 --> 00:36:00,360
You've changed a lot.

541
00:36:03,190 --> 00:36:04,000
I guess.

542
00:36:05,150 --> 00:36:05,960
Life

543
00:36:06,550 --> 00:36:08,080
