544
00:36:09,030 --> 00:36:09,890
What about you?

545
00:36:10,150 --> 00:36:11,350
How are you doing now?

546
00:36:12,340 --> 00:36:14,150
I found an internship.

547
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:16,360
What are your plans after that?

548
00:36:16,940 --> 00:36:18,940
