551
00:36:23,590 --> 00:36:24,190
Mm-hmm.

552
00:36:26,650 --> 00:36:27,050
What about you?

553
00:36:27,050 --> 00:36:28,230
I heard from Fu Zhengchu

554
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:30,030
