555
00:36:30,500 --> 00:36:32,630
I should be able to graduate this time.

556
00:36:35,300 --> 00:36:36,090
Senior?

557
00:36:36,230 --> 00:36:36,900
I was wondering why

558
00:36:36,900 --> 00:36:38,160
