559
00:36:38,760 --> 00:36:39,550
Hello.

560
00:36:39,760 --> 00:36:41,230
Is this your girlfriend?

561
00:36:44,530 --> 00:36:45,940
She's so pretty!

562
00:36:49,190 --> 00:36:51,030
Hello, I'm Lin Jingran.

563
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:52,630
Hello.

564
00:36:54,260 --> 00:36:56,090
Senior, can I sit here?

565
00:36:56,090 --> 00:36:56,840
No.

566
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,190
Go away.

567
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:02,500
Alright, I'll head back then.

568
00:37:02,550 --> 00:37:03,480
Bye, beautiful.

569
00:37:03,940 --> 00:37:04,960
Bye, Senior.

570
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:08,910
Sorry.

571
00:37:08,940 --> 00:37:11,130
He likes to joke around.

572
00:37:11,630 --> 00:37:12,440
It's fine.

573
00:37:12,440 --> 00:37:14,440
People often joke with me like that.

574
00:37:17,080 --> 00:37:18,900
When I'm with Yun Ye.

575
00:37:27,940 --> 00:37:29,340
Are you graduating soon?

576
00:37:29,510 --> 00:37:30,110
Yeah.

577
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:32,230
I'm writing my thesis.

578
00:37:33,460 --> 00:37:34,320
What about you?

579
00:37:35,340 --> 00:37:36,780
Yeah, almost.

580
00:37:40,860 --> 00:37:43,210
What are your plans after that?

581
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:48,230
After that,

582
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:51,930
I might go abroad

583
00:37:52,740 --> 00:37:53,650
for a postdoc.

584
00:37:58,070 --> 00:37:59,650
Alright.

585
00:37:59,690 --> 00:38:01,650
Are you going alone?

586
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:06,150
Who else would I go with?

587
00:38:10,590 --> 00:38:11,550
No, I just...

588
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:13,190
I just think going abroad alone

589
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:14,190
is quite hard.

590
00:38:14,190 --> 00:38:14,940
That's it...

591
00:38:23,380 --> 00:38:23,940
No.

592
00:38:24,530 --> 00:38:25,590
It'll be just me.

593
00:38:30,090 --> 00:38:31,550
But I haven't decided yet.

594
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:33,600
I might just stay in the country,

595
00:38:34,500 --> 00:38:36,550
or I might go abroad

596
00:38:37,300 --> 00:38:38,430
and never come back.

597
00:38:40,170 --> 00:38:41,340
N-Never come back?

598
00:38:42,210 --> 00:38:42,900
Yeah.

599
00:38:46,730 --> 00:38:47,730
It's pretty good.

600
00:38:54,300 --> 00:38:55,300
It's a good thing.

601
00:38:56,690 --> 00:38:58,690
I went to the UK last year

602
00:38:58,690 --> 00:39:00,090
for an exchange program.

603
00:39:03,500 --> 00:39:04,300
How was it?

604
00:39:05,100 --> 00:39:06,760
It was okay. It's just that...

605
00:39:06,860 --> 00:39:09,460
I couldn't get used to it
for the first 6 months.

606
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,090
So it was...

607
00:39:17,030 --> 00:39:18,090
not very good then?

608
00:39:21,080 --> 00:39:22,410
You can tell me about it.

609
00:39:27,090 --> 00:39:28,620
If it's convenient for you.

610
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:34,400
Now that it's come up so suddenly,

611
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:34,860
I don't even know

612
00:39:34,860 --> 00:39:36,840
where to start.

613
00:39:38,630 --> 00:39:39,530
It's okay.

614
00:39:40,190 --> 00:39:41,790
You can start from anywhere.

615
00:39:42,570 --> 00:39:44,230
Anywhere?

616
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:44,920
Yeah.

617
00:39:47,540 --> 00:39:49,310
There's too much to say.

618
00:39:50,190 --> 00:39:51,850
We can talk as much as you want,

619
00:39:52,950 --> 00:39:53,970
as long as you don't have

620
00:39:53,970 --> 00:39:55,770
anything else to do later today.

621
00:39:59,730 --> 00:40:01,130
When I first got there,

622
00:40:01,130 --> 00:40:04,130
I wasn't used to the language,

623
00:40:04,130 --> 00:40:06,400
so I didn't dare
to communicate with others.

624
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,390
At that time,

625
00:40:07,420 --> 00:40:09,750
Tang Lin was in a different city
because of

626
00:40:09,900 --> 00:40:11,240
changes to her project.

627
00:40:11,340 --> 00:40:12,940
So I had to live all by myself.

628
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:34,000
But I got used to it
in the second half of the year.

629
00:40:34,000 --> 00:40:35,230
At that time, I was always sharing

630
00:40:35,230 --> 00:40:37,130
technical knowledge
on EAW in my spare time.

631
00:40:37,130 --> 00:40:39,130
My channel hit a bit of a milestone,

632
00:40:39,130 --> 00:40:40,930
reaching 3,000,000 followers.

633
00:40:40,950 --> 00:40:42,260
When things were difficult back then,

634
00:40:42,260 --> 00:40:43,860
I would read those comments.

635
00:40:44,970 --> 00:40:46,370
They encouraged me a lot.

636
00:40:48,530 --> 00:40:50,400
Forget it. It was nothing special.

637
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:51,650
It was just okay.

638
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:54,800
I originally thought I definitely wouldn't

639
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:56,650
be able to make it there on my own.

640
00:40:57,230 --> 00:40:58,510
I didn't expect to be so good

641
00:40:58,510 --> 00:40:59,770
at fending for myself.

642
00:41:09,050 --> 00:41:10,510
Do you want to go see my lab?

643
00:41:18,730 --> 00:41:19,650
Oh no, Senior!

644
00:41:19,900 --> 00:41:21,430
Junior crashed the system!

645
00:41:23,380 --> 00:41:25,440
Senior, you go ahead with your thing.

646
00:41:25,730 --> 00:41:26,940
It's not a big deal.

647
00:41:28,050 --> 00:41:28,960
It's okay.

648
00:41:29,150 --> 00:41:30,260
You go ahead.

649
00:41:33,090 --> 00:41:33,900
Alright then.

650
00:41:34,300 --> 00:41:35,900
I'll show it to you next time.

651
00:41:36,150 --> 00:41:37,690
Alright. It's fine.

652
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:41,950
I'll get going then.

653
00:41:48,170 --> 00:41:48,860
Senior,

654
00:41:48,940 --> 00:41:50,050
is she really not your girlfriend?

655
00:41:50,050 --> 00:41:51,300
Just admit she is.

656
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,630
She's not.

657
00:41:55,460 --> 00:41:56,690
You are chasing her?

658
00:41:57,340 --> 00:41:58,730
Just tell me.

659
00:41:58,840 --> 00:41:59,980
We'll help you chase her.

660
00:41:59,980 --> 00:42:01,050
You talk too much.

661
00:42:01,320 --> 00:42:01,850
Let's go.

662
00:42:09,340 --> 00:42:10,600
Look at this young man.

663
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:11,730
Looks sharp.

664
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:12,900
He's a high school teacher.

665
00:42:12,900 --> 00:42:14,700
He looks honest at first glance.

666
00:42:15,650 --> 00:42:18,190
He looks sharp or honest?
Give me an accurate description.

667
00:42:18,190 --> 00:42:19,260
Is that the point?

668
00:42:19,940 --> 00:42:20,690
If our Yun Li

669
00:42:20,690 --> 00:42:21,960
gets together with him,

670
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,890
they can teach their kids themselves.

671
00:42:23,890 --> 00:42:26,590
Helping their kids with homework
won't be a problem.

672
00:42:26,590 --> 00:42:28,340
You're thinking too far ahead.

673
00:42:29,150 --> 00:42:30,030
Look at this one.

674
00:42:30,030 --> 00:42:31,360
This one is even better.

675
00:42:32,690 --> 00:42:33,760
A local from Xifu.

676
00:42:34,860 --> 00:42:36,190
He has a master's degree

677
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,660
and is a civil servant.

678
00:42:39,940 --> 00:42:42,340
You're not the one
looking for a boyfriend.

679
00:42:42,760 --> 00:42:44,440
Stop meddling.

680
00:42:44,530 --> 00:42:45,730
When it comes to this,

681
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:46,590
you should let her

682
00:42:46,590 --> 00:42:48,000
find someone she likes.

683
00:42:48,150 --> 00:42:50,760
These days, people believe in the freedom
to choose their own partners.

684
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:52,050
Freedom to choose their own partners?

685
00:42:52,050 --> 00:42:53,500
Freedom has its limits,

686
00:42:53,500 --> 00:42:54,090
right?

687
00:42:54,190 --> 00:42:54,860
If we don't

688
00:42:54,860 --> 00:42:55,730
look out for her,

689
00:42:55,730 --> 00:42:57,730
what if she gets taken advantage of?

690
00:42:59,560 --> 00:43:00,350
Lili.

691
00:43:02,930 --> 00:43:04,090
I made some soup for you.

692
00:43:04,090 --> 00:43:05,090
I'll go heat it up.

693
00:43:05,090 --> 00:43:06,300
Okay. Thanks, Mom.

694
00:43:06,940 --> 00:43:07,670
Yun Li, Yun Li.

695
00:43:07,670 --> 00:43:08,730
Come here and look.

696
00:43:10,050 --> 00:43:11,090
Your third aunt

697
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:13,260
has found you a few more young men.

698
00:43:13,260 --> 00:43:14,590
I went through them all,

699
00:43:14,630 --> 00:43:16,630
and this one seems pretty reliable.

700
00:43:16,630 --> 00:43:17,550
He's from Xifu,

701
00:43:17,630 --> 00:43:19,630
has a master's degree,
and graduated 2 years ago.

702
00:43:19,630 --> 00:43:20,760
He's a civil servant

703
00:43:21,050 --> 00:43:22,150
with a steady income

704
00:43:22,150 --> 00:43:23,210
and good benefits.

705
00:43:23,340 --> 00:43:24,530
It's a regular nine-to-five job,

706
00:43:24,530 --> 00:43:25,300
so he'll have time for family.

707
00:43:25,300 --> 00:43:25,940
Dad.

708
00:43:26,020 --> 00:43:26,770
What's wrong?

709
00:43:26,770 --> 00:43:28,000
You don't want to meet this guy too,
do you?

710
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:28,730
Come on.

711
00:43:29,340 --> 00:43:30,860
This time, you have to.

712
00:43:30,910 --> 00:43:31,700
Your third aunt

713
00:43:31,700 --> 00:43:33,190
cares so much about your marriage.

714
00:43:33,190 --> 00:43:34,360
You just keep turning her down.

715
00:43:34,360 --> 00:43:35,440
Is that appropriate?

716
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:36,650
Stop worrying about me.

717
00:43:36,650 --> 00:43:37,230
I can take care of myself.

718
00:43:37,230 --> 00:43:39,260
Stop worrying about you?

719
00:43:39,730 --> 00:43:40,860
If you were taking this seriously
yourself,

720
00:43:40,860 --> 00:43:42,460
would I have to worry so much?

721
00:43:42,500 --> 00:43:43,230
Look at yourself.

722
00:43:43,230 --> 00:43:44,300
How old are you now?

723
00:43:44,500 --> 00:43:45,630
Don't end up like your cousin.

724
00:43:45,630 --> 00:43:46,500
She's been on 20 or 30 blind dates

725
00:43:46,500 --> 00:43:47,400
and still hasn't found anyone she likes.

726
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:48,150
Who knows how long

727
00:43:48,150 --> 00:43:49,530
she'll keep this up?

728
00:43:49,630 --> 00:43:51,380
I just don't like being set up like this.

729
00:43:51,380 --> 00:43:52,690
The process doesn't matter.

730
00:43:52,690 --> 00:43:54,110
The result does!

731
00:43:54,230 --> 00:43:56,000
Dad, let me see if he's handsome.

732
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:57,260
Why are you butting in?

733
00:43:57,300 --> 00:43:58,050
You think just
because I'm talking to your sister,

734
00:43:58,050 --> 00:43:59,180
you're off the hook?

735
00:43:59,940 --> 00:44:00,960
You didn't get into college

736
00:44:00,960 --> 00:44:01,690
to...

737
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:03,800
Dad, I know.

738
00:44:03,800 --> 00:44:04,860
I'll go check on Li.

739
00:44:05,230 --> 00:44:05,730
Wait!

740
00:44:07,690 --> 00:44:08,650
These two kids.
